Package: save
Version: 1.1.7-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Recommends: aria2
Maintainer: Bonny <bonny@example.com>
Description: Download videos from YouTube, TikTok, Facebook, and more
 A terminal tool for downloading videos from YouTube, TikTok, Facebook,
 and hundreds of other sites, with an interactive format picker and
 optional multi-connection acceleration via aria2c.
 This package is self-contained: it bundles the application runtime and
 its own yt-dlp, ffmpeg, ffprobe, and Deno binaries, so no media tools
 need to be installed separately.
